// macro-parenthesis-adjacency follow-up. Measured against the established compiler (2026-09-24).
// The scan never OUTPUTS, so an untokenisable body met through a used
// parameter inside an unused argument still does not reach the stream:
// the established compiler ACCEPTS.
#define BAD (1.0)
#define KEEP(x) x
#define DROP(x) 1.0
float4 main() : COLOR { return float4(DROP(KEEP(BAD)), 0, 0, 1); }
